# E30 Skynet, the variant commented in its Program.cs: sequential, random order: a variant of the oracles (tests/tools/csharp-ref/ref/Oracles/SkynetSeqRandom/), compared as Skynet (rules/Skynet.rules).
cover all
fact sum ^Sum = (\d+)$
fact duration ^\d+\.000 ms$
same sum seq
same duration count
check sum count == 1
